msgstr "คลังระบบ"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:51
msgid "Custom Source"
msgstr "แหล่งข้อมูลกำหนดเอง"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:138
msgid ""
"Knowledge the AI shelved on its own (always unconfirmed at first). "
"Confirm/edit what is correct, retire what is wrong — see it cited as [AI "
"정리 — 미확인] until reviewed."
msgstr "ความรู้ที่ AI จัดเก็บด้วยตัวเองโดยอัตโนมัติ (ยังไม่ยืนยันเสมอในตอนแรก) ยืนยัน/แก้ไขสิ่งที่ถูกต้อง ถอนสิ่งที่ผิด — จะถูกอ้างอิงเป็น [AI 정리 — 미확인] จนกว่าจะได้รับการตรวจทาน"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:310
msgid ""
"Google Picker is not configured yet — an admin must set the Picker API "
"key under Settings > Integrations."
msgstr "ยังไม่ได้ตั้งค่า Google Picker — ผู้ดูแลระบบต้องตั้งค่าคีย์ API ของ Picker ที่ การตั้งค่า > การเชื่อมต่อระบบภายนอก"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:343
msgid ""
"Enter your service key, then use the Farm and Season pickers below to "
"choose your farm by region and season by name — the internal IDs are "
"filled in for you, so you never have to type a code."
msgstr "ป้อนคีย์บริการของคุณ จากนั้นใช้ตัวเลือกฟาร์มและฤดูกาลด้านล่างเพื่อเลือกฟาร์มตามภูมิภาคและฤดูกาลตามชื่อ — รหัสภายในจะถูกกรอกให้โดยอัตโนมัติ คุณจึงไม่ต้องพิมพ์รหัสเอง"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/ai_library.html:345
msgid ""
"A classification code from the measurement record — the example is one "
"real sample value, not a fixed option; actual values vary per record."
msgstr "รหัสการจำแนกจากบันทึกการวัด — ตัวอย่างคือค่าตัวอย่างจริงหนึ่งค่า ไม่ใช่ตัวเลือกตายตัว ค่าจริงจะแตกต่างกันไปในแต่ละบันทึก"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/components/getting_to_know.html:304
msgid ""
"You will now see: AI Status, your key keywords, and how the AI is "
"learning about your facility."
msgstr ""
"ตอนนี้คุณจะเห็น สถานะ AI คำสำคัญหลักของคุณ และวิธีที่ AI "
"เรียนรู้เกี่ยวกับสถานที่ของคุณ"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/components/onboarding_flow.html:18
msgid ""
"This AI system requires a learning period to provide advice customized to"
" your facility."
msgstr ""
"ระบบ AI "
"นี้ต้องการช่วงเวลาเรียนรู้เพื่อให้คำแนะนำที่ปรับให้เหมาะกับสถานที่ของคุณ"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/components/onboarding_flow.html:87
msgid ""
"This AI advisor learns from your facility over time. During the initial "
"learning period, advice is based on general agricultural knowledge and "
"may not be specific to your conditions. Your feedback — confirming, "
"adjusting, or rejecting suggestions — is what calibrates the system to "
"your facility. The system will tell you when it is uncertain and what "
"confirmation would help. You remain in control: no automated actions will"
" be taken without your approval."
msgstr ""
"AI Advisor นี้เรียนรู้เกี่ยวกับสถานที่ของคุณไปตามกาลเวลา "
"ในช่วงเรียนรู้เริ่มต้น คำแนะนำจะอ้างอิงจากความรู้ทางการเกษตรทั่วไป "
"และอาจไม่เจาะจงกับสภาพของคุณเสมอไป ความคิดเห็นของคุณ "
"ไม่ว่าจะเป็นการยืนยัน ปรับแก้ หรือปฏิเสธข้อเสนอแนะ "
"คือสิ่งที่ช่วยปรับเทียบระบบให้เหมาะกับสถานที่ของคุณ "
"ระบบจะแจ้งให้ทราบเมื่อไม่แน่ใจ และการยืนยันแบบใดที่จะเป็นประโยชน์ "
"คุณยังคงเป็นผู้ควบคุม จะไม่มีการดำเนินการอัตโนมัติใด ๆ "
"โดยไม่ได้รับการอนุมัติจากคุณ"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/ai/components/onboarding_flow.html:107
msgid ""
"The AI advisor will begin learning about this facility. The more feedback"
" you provide on its suggestions, the more accurate and customized the "
"advice becomes."
msgstr ""
"AI Advisor จะเริ่มเรียนรู้เกี่ยวกับสถานที่นี้ "
"ยิ่งคุณให้ความคิดเห็นเกี่ยวกับข้อเสนอแนะมากเท่าไร "
"คำแนะนำก็จะยิ่งแม่นยำและปรับให้เหมาะสมมากขึ้นเท่านั้น"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/camera_options/libcamera.html:63
#: aot_flask/templates/pages/camera_options/picamera.html:70
#: aot_flask/templates/pages/camera_options/raspistill.html:46
msgid ""
"Shutter speed in microseconds. Seeting to 0 disables and shutter speed "
"will be automatically determined."
msgstr ""
"ความเร็วชัตเตอร์เป็นไมโครวินาที ตั้งค่าเป็น 0 เพื่อปิดใช้งาน "
"โดยความเร็วชัตเตอร์จะถูกกำหนดโดยอัตโนมัติ"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/camera_options/picamera.html:109
#: aot_flask/templates/pages/camera_options/picamera.html:115
msgid ""
"When Auto White Balance is set to \"Off\", the AWB Red and Blue gains "
"will be used. These represent the red and blue balance of the camera. "
"These values will be between 0.0 and 8.0. Typical values for the gains "
"are between 0.9 and 1.9."
msgstr ""
"เมื่อตั้งค่า Auto White Balance เป็น \"ปิด\" จะใช้ค่าเกน AWB "
"สีแดงและสีน้ำเงิน ซึ่งแสดงถึงสมดุลสีแดง/น้ำเงินของกล้อง "
"ค่าเหล่านี้จะอยู่ระหว่าง 0.0 ถึง 8.0 โดยค่าเกนทั่วไปจะอยู่ระหว่าง 0.9 ถึง"
" 1.9"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/camera_options/picamera.html:121
msgid "With iso settings other than Auto, Exposure Mode becomes non-functional."
msgstr ""
"หากตั้งค่า ISO เป็นค่าอื่นที่ไม่ใช่ Auto โหมดการเปิดรับแสง (Exposure "
"Mode) จะไม่ทำงาน"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/data_options/camera_options.html:247
msgid "Path to save timelapse image files. Leave empty to use default location."
msgstr "Path to save timelapse image files. Leave empty to use default location."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/form_options/Measurements_Select.html:17
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Warning: Saved measurement with ID \"%(measure_id)s\" not found in "
"database. Add the missing unit on the Configure -> Measurement page or "
"change the set measurement."
msgstr ""
"คำเตือน: ไม่พบค่าที่วัดที่บันทึกไว้ซึ่งมีรหัส \"%(measure_id)s\" "
"ในฐานข้อมูล กรุณาเพิ่มหน่วยที่ขาดหายไปในหน้า Configure -> Measurement "
"หรือเปลี่ยนค่าที่วัดที่ตั้งไว้"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/form_options/Measurements_Select.html:24
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Warning: Saved unit with ID \"%(unit_id)s\" not found in database. Add "
"the missing unit on the Configure -> Measurement page or change the set "
"unit."
msgstr ""
"คำเตือน: ไม่พบหน่วยที่บันทึกไว้ซึ่งมีรหัส \"%(unit_id)s\" ในฐานข้อมูล "
"กรุณาเพิ่มหน่วยที่ขาดหายไปในหน้า Configure -> Measurement "
"หรือเปลี่ยนหน่วยที่ตั้งไว้"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/conditional_options.html:45
msgid ""
"Conditional functions can not only execute Python 3 code, but also "
"interact with AoT using conditions and actions within the code."
msgstr "ฟังก์ชันเงื่อนไขไม่เพียงรันโค้ด Python 3 ได้เท่านั้น แต่ยังสามารถโต้ตอบกับ AoT ผ่านเงื่อนไขและการกระทำภายในโค้ดได้ด้วย"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/conditional_options/gpio_state.html:3
#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/conditional_options/measurement_and_ts.html:4
msgid ""
"Returns True if GPIO pin is HIGH, False if LOW. Do not use this to check "
"On/Off GPIO output state. (Using this changes GPIO pin from OUTPUT to "
"INPUT, stopping it from working as output.) Use \"Output State "
"Condition\" to check output state."
msgstr ""
"Returns True if GPIO pin is HIGH, False if LOW. Do not use this to check "
"On/Off GPIO output state. (Using this changes GPIO pin from OUTPUT to "
"INPUT, stopping it from working as output.) Use \"Output State "
"Condition\" to check output state."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/conditional_options/measurement.html:4
msgid ""
"Returns the last value found within the set maximum time, otherwise "
"returns None."
msgstr ""
"Returns the last value found within the set maximum time, otherwise "
"returns None."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/conditional_options/measurement_dict.html:4
msgid ""
"Returns a list of dictionaries containing \"time\" and \"value\" keys "
"found within the set maximum time, otherwise returns None."
msgstr ""
"Returns a list of dictionaries containing \"time\" and \"value\" keys "
"found within the set maximum time, otherwise returns None."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/conditional_options/measurement_past_average.html:4
msgid ""
"Returns the average of values found within the set maximum time, "
"otherwise returns None."
msgstr ""
"Returns the average of values found within the set maximum time, "
"otherwise returns None."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/conditional_options/output_state.html:4
msgid ""
"Returns \"on\" if output is on, \"off\" if off, or duty cycle value if "
"PWM."
msgstr ""
"Returns \"on\" if output is on, \"off\" if off, or duty cycle value if "
"PWM."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/pid_options/output_on_off_lower.html:6
msgid ""
"Minimum duration (in seconds) required for lower output to be active. If "
"ON duration is shorter than this, lower output will not turn on."
msgstr ""
"Minimum duration (in seconds) required for lower output to be active. If "
"ON duration is shorter than this, lower output will not turn on."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/pid_options/output_on_off_lower.html:13
msgid ""
"Maximum duration (in seconds) that lower output can be on during a cycle."
" If ON duration is larger than this, lower output turns on only for the "
"set duration. Enter 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Maximum duration (in seconds) that lower output can be on during a cycle."
" If ON duration is larger than this, lower output turns on only for the "
"set duration. Enter 0 to disable."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/pid_options/output_on_off_raise.html:6
msgid ""
"Minimum duration (in seconds) required for upper output to be active. If "
"ON duration is shorter than this, upper output will not turn on."
msgstr ""
"Minimum duration (in seconds) required for upper output to be active. If "
"ON duration is shorter than this, upper output will not turn on."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/pid_options/output_on_off_raise.html:13
msgid ""
"Maximum duration (in seconds) that upper output can be on during a cycle."
" If ON duration is larger than this, upper output turns on only for the "
"set duration. Enter 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Maximum duration (in seconds) that upper output can be on during a cycle."
" If ON duration is larger than this, upper output turns on only for the "
"set duration. Enter 0 to disable."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/pid_options/output_value_lower.html:6
msgid ""
"Minimum value required for lower output to be active. If smaller than "
"this, lower output will not turn on."
msgstr ""
"Minimum value required for lower output to be active. If smaller than "
"this, lower output will not turn on."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/pid_options/output_value_lower.html:13
msgid ""
"Maximum value for lower output during a cycle. If value exceeds this, "
"lower output turns on by the set value. Enter 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Maximum value for lower output during a cycle. If value exceeds this, "
"lower output turns on by the set value. Enter 0 to disable."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/pid_options/output_value_raise.html:6
msgid ""
"Minimum value required for upper output to be active. If smaller than "
"this, upper output will not turn on."
msgstr ""
"Minimum value required for upper output to be active. If smaller than "
"this, upper output will not turn on."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/pid_options/output_value_raise.html:13
msgid ""
"Maximum value for upper output during a cycle. If value exceeds this, "
"upper output turns on by the set value. Enter 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Maximum value for upper output during a cycle. If value exceeds this, "
"upper output turns on by the set value. Enter 0 to disable."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/pid_options/output_volume_lower.html:6
msgid ""
"Minimum output size required for lower output to be active. If smaller "
"than this, lower output will not turn on."
msgstr ""
"Minimum output size required for lower output to be active. If smaller "
"than this, lower output will not turn on."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/pid_options/output_volume_lower.html:13
msgid ""
"Maximum output size for lower output to be maintained during a cycle. If "
"larger than this, lower output is maintained only for max duration. Enter"
" 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Maximum output size for lower output to be maintained during a cycle. If "
"larger than this, lower output is maintained only for max duration. Enter"
" 0 to disable."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/pid_options/output_volume_raise.html:6
msgid ""
"Minimum output size required for upper output to be active. If smaller "
"than this, upper output will not turn on."
msgstr ""
"Minimum output size required for upper output to be active. If smaller "
"than this, upper output will not turn on."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/pid_options/output_volume_raise.html:13
msgid ""
"Maximum output size for upper output to be maintained during a cycle. If "
"larger than this, upper output is maintained only for max duration. Enter"
" 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Maximum output size for upper output to be maintained during a cycle. If "
"larger than this, upper output is maintained only for max duration. Enter"
" 0 to disable."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/trigger_options/output_pwm.html:16
msgid ""
"Execute this condition when the measured value is greater or less than "
"the set value, or the measured timestamp is greater than the value in "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"Execute this condition when the measured value is greater or less than "
"the set value, or the measured timestamp is greater than the value in "
"seconds."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/function_options/trigger_options/sunrise_sunset.html:19
