"AoT provides <strong>no legal warranty</strong> regarding the accuracy or"
" suitability of the outputs, and the user is responsible for construction"
" and decision-making based on them."
msgstr ""
"AoT provides <strong>no legal warranty</strong> regarding the accuracy or"
" suitability of the outputs, and the user is responsible for construction"
" and decision-making based on them."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_design.html:720
msgid ""
"Enter addresses in the first column of the CSV file. Adjacent parcels are"
" merged automatically."
msgstr ""
"ป้อนที่อยู่ในคอลัมน์แรกของไฟล์ CSV "
"แปลงที่ดินที่อยู่ติดกันจะถูกรวมเข้าด้วยกันโดยอัตโนมัติ"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:1132
