msgstr ""
"ลงทะเบียนอุปกรณ์เซนเซอร์และกำหนดรายการวัดค่า ฟังก์ชัน Integrated "
"Environment Control จะอ่านข้อมูลสภาพแวดล้อมจากรายการนี้"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:1751
msgid "Add Sensor"
msgstr "เพิ่มเซนเซอร์"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:1758
msgid "Measurement Channel"
msgstr "ช่องวัดค่า"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:1759
msgid "Measurement Type"
msgstr "ประเภทการวัดค่า"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:1766
msgid "No sensors registered — click [+ Add Sensor] above"
msgstr "ยังไม่มีเซนเซอร์ที่ลงทะเบียน — คลิก [+ เพิ่มเซนเซอร์] ด้านบน"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:1780
msgid ""
"Connect forecast Input devices. Any service (OpenWeatherMap, Open-Meteo, "
"KMA …) works as long as it has an Input plugin that writes values to "
"InfluxDB."
msgstr ""
"เชื่อมต่ออุปกรณ์ Input สำหรับพยากรณ์อากาศ ใช้ได้กับทุกบริการ "
"(OpenWeatherMap, Open-Meteo, KMA …) ตราบใดที่มีปลั๊กอิน Input "
"ที่เขียนค่าเข้า InfluxDB"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:1796
msgid "No weather services connected — click [+ Add Connection] above"
msgstr "ยังไม่มีบริการพยากรณ์อากาศที่เชื่อมต่อ — คลิก [+ เพิ่มการเชื่อมต่อ] ด้านบน"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:1818
msgid ""
"Grouping actuators of the same kind lets the coordinator command only the"
" leader and automatically copy the same command to followers according to"
" the mode."
msgstr ""
"การจัดกลุ่มแอคชูเอเตอร์ชนิดเดียวกันช่วยให้ coordinator "
"สั่งงานเฉพาะตัวลีดเดอร์ "
"และคัดลอกคำสั่งเดียวกันไปยังตัวตามโดยอัตโนมัติตามโหมดที่ตั้งไว้"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:1848
msgid "Label color ranges by measurement item (5 stages)"
msgstr "ช่วงสีป้ายกำกับตามรายการวัดค่า (5 ระดับ)"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:1853
msgid ""
"A facility-wide setting <strong>independent</strong> of sensor "
"devices/channels. Define a color range once per measurement "
"<strong>item</strong>, and every sensor label in the widgets "
"automatically references the range matching its measurement type. You can"
" freely change each stage’s <strong>color</strong> and <strong>upper "
"limit</strong>, and add measurement items you want."
msgstr ""
"การตั้งค่าระดับสิ่งอำนวยความสะดวกที่ <strong>เป็นอิสระ</strong> "
"จากอุปกรณ์/ช่องเซนเซอร์ "
"กำหนดช่วงสีเพียงครั้งเดียวต่อ<strong>รายการ</strong>วัดค่า "
"แล้วป้ายกำกับเซนเซอร์ทั้งหมดในวิดเจ็ตจะอ้างอิงช่วงที่ตรงกับประเภทการวัดค่าของตัวเองโดยอัตโนมัติ"
" "
"คุณสามารถเปลี่ยน<strong>สี</strong>และ<strong>ค่าขีดบน</strong>ของแต่ละระดับได้อย่างอิสระ"
" และเพิ่มรายการวัดค่าที่ต้องการได้"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:1878
msgid ""
"The match key is the measurement-type identifier of the sensor channel "
"(e.g. T, RH, CO2, VPD, light, wind_ms, wind_deg, rain_mm). The color "
"range is applied only when the channel and key match."
msgstr ""
"คีย์การจับคู่คือตัวระบุประเภทการวัดค่าของช่องเซนเซอร์ (เช่น T, RH, CO2, "
"VPD, light, wind_ms, wind_deg, rain_mm) "
"ช่วงสีจะถูกใช้เมื่อช่องและคีย์ตรงกันเท่านั้น"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:2077
msgid ""
"Theoretical value. Shows nameplate when cooler capacity is set on "
"actuator."
msgstr ""
"ค่าคำนวณตามทฤษฎี "
"จะแสดงค่าจากแผ่นป้ายข้อมูลเมื่อตั้งค่าความจุเครื่องทำความเย็นบนแอคชูเอเตอร์แล้ว"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_facility.html:2078
msgid ""
"Theoretical value. Shows nameplate when heater capacity is set on "
"actuator."
msgstr ""
"ค่าคำนวณตามทฤษฎี "
"จะแสดงค่าจากแผ่นป้ายข้อมูลเมื่อตั้งค่าความจุฮีตเตอร์บนแอคชูเอเตอร์แล้ว"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_setting.html:314
msgid ""
"Limit max polygons for Sites. Sites exceeding this limit will be rendered"
" as points."
msgstr ""
"Limit max polygons for Sites. Sites exceeding this limit will be rendered"
" as points."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo/geo_setting.html:327
msgid ""
"Limit max polygons for Zones. Zones exceeding this limit will be rendered"
" as points."
msgstr ""
"Limit max polygons for Zones. Zones exceeding this limit will be rendered"
" as points."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/geo_input_components/geo_input_option.html:231
msgid ""
"Upload a drone or aerial photo (JPG/PNG/TIFF). GPS/EXIF in the photo is "
"used to place it automatically when available."
msgstr ""
"อัปโหลดภาพถ่ายจากโดรนหรือภาพถ่ายทางอากาศ (JPG/PNG/TIFF) หากภาพมีข้อมูล "
"GPS/EXIF จะถูกใช้เพื่อวางตำแหน่งให้โดยอัตโนมัติ"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/method_options/build_cascade.html:3
msgid ""
"Combines the output of multiple methods. All listed methods run in "
"parallel, and their outputs are multiplied. If any one of the cascaded "
"methods terminates, the combined method also terminates."
msgstr ""
"Combines the output of multiple methods. All listed methods run in "
"parallel, and their outputs are multiplied. If any one of the cascaded "
"methods terminates, the combined method also terminates."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/method_options/build_cascade.html:9
msgid ""
"Run this duration method to set the output PWM duty cycle using the "
"output value"
msgstr ""
"Run this duration method to set the output PWM duty cycle using the "
"output value"

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/method_options/build_daily.html:3
msgid ""
"Defines setpoints over a period of time based on specific time slots. "
"This method repeats daily. To fill the entire day, start the first entry "
"at midnight (00:00)."
msgstr ""
"Defines setpoints over a period of time based on specific time slots. "
"This method repeats daily. To fill the entire day, start the first entry "
"at midnight (00:00)."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/method_options/build_daily.html:4
msgid ""
"The start time of a new entry can be equal to the end time of the last "
"entry, but it cannot overlap. If there are any unassigned times, the "
"PID's default setpoint will be used."
msgstr ""
"The start time of a new entry can be equal to the end time of the last "
"entry, but it cannot overlap. If there are any unassigned times, the "
"PID's default setpoint will be used."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/method_options/build_daily_bezier.html:3
msgid ""
"Defines daily settings based on a cubic Bezier curve. If you are not "
"familiar with Bezier curves, it is recommended to use the <a "
"href=\"https://www.desmos.com/calculator/cahqdxeshd\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Graphic Bezier Curve Generator</a> to utilize 8 "
"variables for 4 points (x and y each). The start point (x3) and end point"
" (x0) of the x-axis are automatically stretched or tilted to fit 24 "
"hours, and this method repeats daily."
msgstr ""
"Defines daily settings based on a cubic Bezier curve. If you are not "
"familiar with Bezier curves, it is recommended to use the <a "
"href=\"https://www.desmos.com/calculator/cahqdxeshd\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Graphic Bezier Curve Generator</a> to utilize 8 "
"variables for 4 points (x and y each). The start point (x3) and end point"
" (x0) of the x-axis are automatically stretched or tilted to fit 24 "
"hours, and this method repeats daily."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/method_options/build_daily_sine.html:3
msgid ""
"Defines setpoints over a day in the form of y = [A * sin(B * x + C)] + D."
" Here, A represents amplitude, B represents frequency, C represents phase"
" shift, and D represents y-axis shift. This method repeats daily."
msgstr ""
"Defines setpoints over a day in the form of y = [A * sin(B * x + C)] + D."
" Here, A represents amplitude, B represents frequency, C represents phase"
" shift, and D represents y-axis shift. This method repeats daily."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/method_options/build_date.html:4
msgid ""
"The start time of a new entry can be equal to the end time of the last "
"entry, but it cannot overlap. For missing times, the PID's default "
"setpoint will be used."
msgstr ""
"The start time of a new entry can be equal to the end time of the last "
"entry, but it cannot overlap. For missing times, the PID's default "
"setpoint will be used."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/method_options/build_duration.html:7
msgid "Defines setpoints over a period of time according to a specific duration."
msgstr "Defines setpoints over a period of time according to a specific duration."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/method_options/build_duration.html:8
msgid ""
"Here, duration is defined as the amount of time after the previous "
"duration. If this is the first duration added, it signifies the start of "
"the action. If it is not the first, it will run after the last duration "
"added to the existing action."
msgstr ""
"Here, duration is defined as the amount of time after the previous "
"duration. If this is the first duration added, it signifies the start of "
"the action. If it is not the first, it will run after the last duration "
"added to the existing action."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/method_options/build_duration.html:30
msgid ""
"Use the following option to instruct the action to restart when it "
"reaches the end."
msgstr ""
"Use the following option to instruct the action to restart when it "
"reaches the end."

#: aot_flask/templates/pages/method_options/build_duration.html:39
msgid ""
"Using this option instructs to restart after the action ends. Once this "
"option is used, you can no longer add more durations. Would you like to "
"add the restart option to the end of this action?"
msgstr ""
"Using this option instructs to restart after the action ends. Once this "
"option is used, you can no longer add more durations. Would you like to "
"add the restart option to the end of this action?"

